" end="01:00.150">broken</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.150" end="01:06.510"><span begin="01:00.150" end="01:00.420">I'm </span><span begin="01:00.420" end="01:00.600">a </span><span begin="01:00.600" end="01:01.050">good </span><span begin="01:01.050" end="01:02.040">son</span><span begin="01:02.040" end="01:04.920">, </span><span begin="01:04.920" end="01:05.490">you're </span><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:05.700">a </span><span begin="01:05.700" end="01:06.180">good </span><span begin="01:06.180" end="01:06.510">son</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.990" end="01:11.880"><span begin="01:09.990" end="01:10.590">You're </span><span begin="01:10.590" end="01:10.740">a </span><span begin="01:10.740" end="01:11.190">good </span><span begin="01:11.190" end="01:11.610">son </span><span begin="01:11.610" end="01:11.610">（</span><span begin="01:11.610" end="01:11.880">x3</span><span begin="01:11.880" end="01:11.880">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.880" end="01:16.080"><span begin="01:11.880" end="01:12.720">[</span><span begin="01:12.720" end="01:13.560">Change</span><span begin="01:13.560" end="01:14.400">-</span><span begin="01:14.400" end="01:15.240">Up</span><span begin="01:15.240" end="01:16.080">]</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.080" end="01:18.720"><span begin="01:16.080" end="01:16.380">[</span><span begin="01:16.380" end="01:16.500">Bridge</span><span begin="01:16.500" end="01:18.720">]</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.720" end="01:25.020"><span begin="01:18.720" end="01:19.980">Free </span><span begin="01:19.980" end="01:21.240">information</span><span begin="01:21.240" end="01:22.500">, </span><span begin="01:22.500" end="01:23.760">free </span><span begin="01:23.760" end="01:25.020">information</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.240" end="01:54.690"><span begin="01:48.240" end="01:49.470">Free </span><span begin="01:49.470" end="01:51.870">information</span><span begin="01:51.870" end="01:51.870">, </span><sp